  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.17 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Registration of Funeral Directors and Embalmers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.17 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Registration of Funeral Directors and Embalmers. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.17, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of registration of funeral directors and embalmers under RSA 325:\n\nTable 1002.17 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Registration of Funeral Directors and Embalmers\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nApprentice license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 2 years | $121\n\nEmbalmer license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $170\n\nFuneral director license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $330\n\nFuneral home license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $181\n\nFuneral chapel license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $181\n\nCrematory license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $220\n\nSource. #13420, eff 8-8-22; ss by #13703, eff 8-1-23 (formerly Plc 1002.16); ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
